  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;djande System Revision av Aegis Trust, uppf&#xf6;ljn</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supportive System Audit of Aegis Trust, follow-up</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen best&#xe5;r av en revision som uppf&#xf6;ljning av Aegis Trust interna kontrollsystem som uppdaterats under den f&#xf6;rberedande fasen av        projektet: Fredsskapande efter folkmord - st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r en Rwandisk        sammanh&#xe5;llning (51160033). Uppdraget genomf&#xf6;rs av konsultfirman       Professional Management AB och har upphandlats via Sida&#xb4;s ramverk     (F92007).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The assignment is a review to follow-up on Aegis Trust&#xb4;s internal     control system, that have updated during the preparatory phase of the Peace making after Genocide - building Rwandan unity project          (51160033). The assignment is carried out by the consultancy company  Professional Management AB and procured through Sida&#xb4;s Framework      (F92007).</narrative>
  </description>
